{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">網上熱傳一段影片，有網民於馬鞍山昂平高原行山期間，目擊一對男女行山客企圖騷擾流浪牛隻。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-08-31 下午3.49.14.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026GdJzZrC1lo1788163728.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-08-31 下午3.49.14.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">從流傳的片段所見，該對男女行山客在山上遇到流浪牛後，不但沒有保持距離，該名男子更以普通話向女伴說：「跨一點就下來嘛，快點！」該名女子聞言後，竟真的試圖跨上牛背拍照打卡。在一旁拍片的目擊者見狀，隨即挺身而出開聲阻止，大呼：「喂！唔好呀，影住你！」該對男女聽到目擊者的警告後，隨即急急腳離開現場。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-08-31 下午3.49.01.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026O4SzYO2XIb1788163720.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-08-31 下午3.49.01.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">影片曝光後引起大批網民熱議，不少人留言鬧爆該對行山客的行為極度缺德且危險，直斥：「騎牛牛好好玩咩？」、「如果俾牛撞落山，不要問點解」，亦有網民語重心長地呼籲大眾愛護環境：「人和大自然係應該和諧相處，做乜係都要摘樹騎動物。」</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-08-31 下午3.48.56.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/20261TkgZNO8841788163697.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-08-31 下午3.48.56.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-31T08:19:55.242352+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":302,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}